<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge grows to 75.4480 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge grows to 75.4480 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.4480 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday after 75.5000 on Friday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     July 21		 July 18</p>
<p> High			     75.6400		 75.5500</p>
<p> Low				75.4252		 75.2101</p>
<p> Open			     75.6400		 75.2101</p>
<p> Close			    75.4480		 75.5000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  2.175		   1.415</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
